Description: Processes 'ForenSeq' Flanking Region Reports, assigns haplotypes using an internal or user-supplied haplotype database, and creates Familias-compatible TXT files. The package also generates simplified Excel review reports to inspect final calls, loci requiring manual review, and all observed sequences.
